Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC-BY-4.0)

This dataset is a cloud-native repackaging of Meta's "DINOv3 Global Canopy
Height Map v2 (ml3)" dataset. The underlying canopy-height data is produced by
Meta AI / Data for Good and is licensed under CC-BY-4.0.

Original data:
  Meta Data for Good — Canopy Height Maps
  s3://dataforgood-fb-data/forests/v2/global/dinov3_global_chm_v2_ml3/
  https://dataforgood.facebook.com/dfg/tools/canopy-height-maps

This repackaging (GeoParquet tile index, STAC catalog, and VirtualiZarr GeoZarr
manifest) is produced by Taylor Geospatial Engine Labs and is likewise released
under CC-BY-4.0. It contains NO copies of the underlying raster pixels — the COG
assets are referenced in place from Meta's public S3 bucket.

You are free to share and adapt this material for any purpose, provided you give
appropriate credit to both Meta (Data for Good) and Taylor Geospatial Engine
Labs, provide a link to the license, and indicate if changes were made.

Full license text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

Cite the underlying method:
  Tolan et al., "Very high resolution canopy height maps from RGB imagery using
  self-supervised vision transformer and convolutional decoder trained on Aerial
  Lidar." (2024) https://arxiv.org/abs/2304.07213
